    "detailed_description": "<h1>Warning!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains scenes of violence, sudden flashes of light, unexpected sound effects, and psychologically intense moments that may cause fear, anxiety, or panic attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have heart problems, epilepsy, or other conditions related to light sensitivity and stress, it is strongly advised to refrain from playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with caution. Your health comes first!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.poster.avif?t=1749893197\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.webm?t=1749893197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.mp4?t=1749893197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nikolai, broken by his past as a soldier, relives the same pain day after day. Will you be able to walk this path with him and face his struggles, or will it all end\u2026 in tragedy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories of the past collide with the present, creating distorted visions, where the line between home and the battlefield grows ever thinner. You will have to make choices that lead to different endings. But what if the truth isn\u2019t what you remember?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features elements of non-linearity and interactivity\u2014nothing stops you from staring at the night street, taking a bitter drag of your cigarette...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits You:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong psychological undertone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, the one ray of sunshine in this wretched cage\u2014Olechka!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/2d28807b0075e9952fdf73771211d6bd.avif?t=1749893197\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.poster.avif?t=1749893197\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.webm?t=1749893197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/b6a434acf1db998e394ce9df7d4a992a.mp4?t=1749893197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nikolai, broken by his past as a soldier, relives the same pain day after day. Will you be able to walk this path with him and face his struggles, or will it all end\u2026 in tragedy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories of the past collide with the present, creating distorted visions, where the line between home and the battlefield grows ever thinner. You will have to make choices that lead to different endings. But what if the truth isn\u2019t what you remember?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features elements of non-linearity and interactivity\u2014nothing stops you from staring at the night street, taking a bitter drag of your cigarette...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits You:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong psychological undertone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, the one ray of sunshine in this wretched cage\u2014Olechka!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486500/extras/2d28807b0075e9952fdf73771211d6bd.avif?t=1749893197\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul>",
